OL,3,AMan pleads guilty to harassing Jess
OL,4,APhillips MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to two charges
OL,7,Fof harassing the Labour MP Jess
OL,8,FPhillips by sending her aggressive and
OL,9,Fthreatening emails.
OL,11,FAt Gloucester Crown Court, Lee Owens,
OL,12,F47, admitted sending an "excessive
OL,13,Fvolume" of emails to Phillips, the MP
OL,14,Ffor Birmingham Yardley, between January
OL,15,F22 and January 25, and July 10 and July
OL,16,F14 last year.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
