OL,3,AMan pleads guilty to harassing Jess
OL,4,APhillips MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhillips, the former minister for
OL,7,Fsafeguarding and violence against women
OL,8,Fand girls, said in a statement: "While
OL,9,FI already have a tiring and difficult
OL,10,Fjob trying to help victims of
OL,11,Fharassment and abuse get justice and
OL,12,Fcare, it's made even harder when you
OL,13,Fare suffering as a victim yourself."
OL,15,FOwens, of Matson in Gloucester, will be
OL,16,Fsentenced on 7 January 2027.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
